BACKUP ~weidu_external/backup/pst_curst~
SUPPORT ~https://github.com/error902/pst-curst-mod/issues~
VERSION ~0.2.0~
AUTO_EVAL_STRINGS

README ~pst_curst/readme/readme.html~ ~README.md~

ALWAYS
  OUTER_SET IS_PSTEE = (GAME_IS ~pstee~)
  OUTER_SET IS_PST = (GAME_IS ~pst~)

  // When you add non-ASCII TRA or more languages, convert UTF-8 TRA for classic PST
  // with HANDLE_CHARSETS (see PST-UB-reloaded or EE Fixpack for a full example).
END

LANGUAGE
  ~English~
  ~english~
  ~pst_curst/languages/english/setup.tra~

////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
BEGIN @1 DESIGNATED 100
LABEL ~pst_curst-main~
REQUIRE_PREDICATE GAME_IS ~pst pstee~ @2
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

WITH_SCOPE BEGIN
  INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/components/main.tph~
END
